      en: ["Located near the ruins of the ancient city of Balasagun.", "The 11th-century Burana Tower is the region's landmark.", "Established in 1864 as a Russian fort on the Chu River.", "Briefly served as the valley's administrative centre in the 19th century.", "The city is home to a significant Dungan community.", "A hub for glass manufacturing and the textile industry.", "Offers panoramic views of the Kyrgyz Range on clear days."]
