      en: ["The name means 'Black Axe' in the Kyrgyz language.", "Was a strategic centre for uranium processing in the USSR.", "Located at the junction of highways to Osh and Tashkent.", "Home to one of the country's largest gold refineries.", "Has a significant Russian and Ukrainian minority population.", "The economy is driven by the sugar and food industries.", "Considered the western gateway to the fertile Chuy Valley."]
