      en: ["Founded in 1930 as a miners' settlement.", "Located in a picturesque gorge on the Naryn River.", "Significant dinosaur skeletons were discovered here.", "Features two large hydroelectric power stations.", "The 'Kristall' plant formerly produced semiconductor materials.", "Well connected via the main Bishkek–Osh highway.", "Coal from this region is considered to be of high quality."]
